# SummaryCard

> Lede 0.7.2's docs for SummaryCard, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/summary-card.md

An `<article>` whose heading is a link that covers the card, with a figure, a one-line takeaway and a status in words.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/summary-card
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md). The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.7.2/summary-card.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { SummaryCard } from '@/components/lede/blocks/summary-card';
```

